WEBVTT

00:50.723 --> 00:53.730
- Oh, son.
- Mother.

00:56.519 --> 00:58.209
Oh my goodness.

00:58.209 --> 00:59.221
Are you okay?

00:59.221 --> 01:00.522
You're not hurt, are you?

01:00.522 --> 01:02.724
Oh my. Goodness.

01:02.724 --> 01:04.630
I'm sorry.

01:04.630 --> 01:06.436
No, it's okay.

01:06.436 --> 01:10.928
Nice to meet you. Hello.

01:10.928 --> 01:13.008
What?

01:13.961 --> 01:15.750
[We're all someone's treasure.]
Ma'am, can we get some water?

01:15.750 --> 01:18.824
- Sure.
- And one more beer, please.

01:18.824 --> 01:20.409
My regular girl?

01:20.409 --> 01:22.870
Oh, it's you.

01:35.568 --> 01:39.430
[Episode 7]

01:42.906 --> 01:45.457
Mom, how come you came without calling?

01:45.457 --> 01:46.490
What about the pub?

01:46.490 --> 01:51.390
I made some fresh side dishes,
so I thought I should bring them over.

01:51.390 --> 01:55.060
Oh dear, I should just drop this off and go.

01:55.060 --> 01:57.184
No, it's okay. You just got here.

01:57.184 --> 01:59.044
You should stay a bit longer.

01:59.044 --> 02:02.683
I'll give you a ride home. Just a second.

02:03.310 --> 02:05.901
Have a seat here for a moment.

02:05.901 --> 02:07.914
I'm so sorry for interrupting your date.

02:07.914 --> 02:10.214
No, not at all.

02:10.214 --> 02:12.851
So, what's your name, dear?

02:12.851 --> 02:15.735
I'm Lee Ui Yeong.

02:15.735 --> 02:17.279
- Lee Ui Yeong.
- Yeah.

02:17.279 --> 02:19.659
I've seen you so many times
and never even asked your name.

02:19.659 --> 02:21.723
You always came in with that boyfriend...

02:21.723 --> 02:23.343
No, I mean, a friend of yours.

02:23.343 --> 02:26.843
You work at a hotel, prefer soju,

02:26.843 --> 02:28.400
and your limit is two...

02:28.400 --> 02:30.650
No, about one bottle.

02:30.650 --> 02:32.564
Jeez, her memory is incredible.

02:32.564 --> 02:35.452
When you keep peeking at customers' tables
to see if they need anything,

02:35.452 --> 02:37.282
you end up overhearing everything.

02:37.282 --> 02:40.839
Recently you said
you were going on a blind date...

02:40.839 --> 02:44.598
Oh, did you meet Tae Seop on that blind date?

02:45.978 --> 02:47.702
Yes. That blind date.

02:47.702 --> 02:50.409
What a coincidence.

02:50.409 --> 02:51.983
How long have you two been seeing each other?

02:51.983 --> 02:54.817
Oh, well...

02:54.817 --> 02:57.130
We're not officially dating yet.

02:57.130 --> 02:59.747
And today's actually the first time
I've come here

02:59.747 --> 03:03.238
because of Tae Seop's glasses.

03:03.238 --> 03:05.138
Well, you're not in your twenties anymore.

03:05.138 --> 03:06.749
I think it's great.

03:06.749 --> 03:08.203
You're both busy people,

03:08.203 --> 03:12.026
so you should take the chance
to enjoy some quality time together.

03:12.026 --> 03:13.646
Yeah?

03:13.646 --> 03:15.232
Shall we go?

03:15.232 --> 03:18.902
I'll drop Ui Yeong off first,
then take you home.

03:23.105 --> 03:25.376
Oh, you two sit in the front.

03:25.376 --> 03:26.800
No, please take the front seat.

03:26.800 --> 03:29.460
- No, I like sitting in the back.
- But...

03:29.460 --> 03:32.540
Go on, sit in the front.

03:33.375 --> 03:36.670
It's fine. Just take the front seat.

03:44.599 --> 03:48.865
You two really look great together.

03:50.285 --> 03:54.292
Mom, it's dangerous if you sit like that.

03:56.511 --> 03:57.868
Oh, right.

03:57.868 --> 04:01.361
Did I say you two look good together?

04:01.361 --> 04:03.614
Yes.

04:03.614 --> 04:07.477
You've been saying that the whole time.

04:07.477 --> 04:11.538
You two look so good together.

04:11.538 --> 04:14.833
Oh my goodness.

04:23.091 --> 04:24.182
Goodbye.

04:24.182 --> 04:27.095
- Get home safe.
- Yes.

04:27.095 --> 04:30.474
- Wait...
- Have a safe trip.

04:31.954 --> 04:34.925
- I'll sit in the front.
- Oh, okay.

04:34.925 --> 04:39.665
I might be saying this
because Tae Seop is my son,

04:39.665 --> 04:41.128
but he's really a good kid.

04:41.128 --> 04:43.559
- Please look kindly on him.
- Yeah.

04:43.559 --> 04:47.574
And if you ever get curious about our family,

04:47.574 --> 04:48.696
just come by the pub.

04:48.696 --> 04:50.744
I'll tell you everything honestly.

04:50.744 --> 04:53.263
- Okay.
- Mom.

04:53.263 --> 04:55.903
Get in.

04:59.100 --> 05:00.557
Have a safe trip.

05:00.557 --> 05:03.343
Head inside.

05:33.201 --> 05:35.650
Dating feels different now.

05:35.650 --> 05:38.908
In your twenties, it was enough
if the two of you just liked each other.

05:38.908 --> 05:43.161
But now I'm at an age
where I can't just think about myself.

05:43.161 --> 05:47.355
It could be my last relationship
before getting married.

05:47.355 --> 05:50.645
The families matter.
Your circumstances have to match too.

05:50.645 --> 05:52.018
Oh my gosh!

05:52.018 --> 05:53.875
That scared me.

05:53.875 --> 05:56.297
Mom, you're home?

05:57.518 --> 05:58.881
Why are you so jumpy?

05:58.881 --> 06:00.955
I thought I walked into someone else's house.

06:00.955 --> 06:04.521
I was just... lost in thought.

06:05.195 --> 06:06.712
Did you go work out?

06:06.712 --> 06:08.870
Yeah, I went for a walk.

06:08.870 --> 06:10.287
What about you?

06:10.287 --> 06:12.578
Me? Well...

06:12.578 --> 06:13.965
Mom,

06:13.965 --> 06:15.889
can I ask you something?

06:15.889 --> 06:19.200
What kind of guy do you think I should date?

06:19.200 --> 06:21.086
Am I the one dating him?

06:21.086 --> 06:24.350
If you're not even sure yourself,
then don't date him.

06:24.350 --> 06:26.970
What a pointless question.

06:26.970 --> 06:29.384
Why did I even ask you?

06:29.384 --> 06:33.432
You never make anything easy for me.
Seriously, are you my stepmom?

06:35.714 --> 06:38.713
I'm showering first.

06:45.793 --> 06:47.096
Fine.

06:47.096 --> 06:49.243
It's my life anyway.

06:49.243 --> 06:52.623
My choice, my responsibility.

07:28.876 --> 07:30.741
I made it home.

07:30.741 --> 07:33.406
My mom made things awkward today, right?

07:33.406 --> 07:36.906
Don't worry too much about it.

07:39.862 --> 07:42.867
No, I had a good time today.

07:42.867 --> 07:48.246
Please tell your mom it was nice meeting her.

07:51.740 --> 07:56.027
I guess I won't be able
to go to that pub anymore.

07:56.027 --> 07:59.733
I just lost a great food spot.

08:30.330 --> 08:31.960
Wait.

08:31.960 --> 08:33.713
Why am I worried about the food spot?

08:33.713 --> 08:36.640
Shouldn't I be worried about something else?

08:37.929 --> 08:39.472
Honey, two orders of chicken feet.

08:39.472 --> 08:41.106
Add extra spicy peppers to one of them.

08:41.106 --> 08:43.207
Yes, honey.

09:03.246 --> 09:04.664
Oh, I can't do that.

09:04.664 --> 09:06.019
No, no.

09:06.019 --> 09:08.825
I'll just stick to eating.

09:13.299 --> 09:15.465
Honey.

09:17.658 --> 09:20.421
- Did you eat something spicy?
- Oh, come on.

09:20.421 --> 09:23.223
It's just lipstick.

09:23.223 --> 09:25.428
Why put on lipstick all of a sudden?

09:25.428 --> 09:27.581
The weather's nice.

09:27.581 --> 09:31.229
When the weather's nice,
flowers bloom, love blooms...

09:31.229 --> 09:34.135
You never know
when a welcome guest might show up.

09:34.135 --> 09:36.079
A welcome guest? Who?

09:36.079 --> 09:38.312
You remember, right?

09:38.312 --> 09:42.129
That regular girl
who closes the door so gently.

09:42.129 --> 09:45.966
The one you said was pretty
because she closes the door softly?

09:45.966 --> 09:47.956
The one who's a couple
with the chicken-breast guy?

09:47.956 --> 09:49.250
You're waiting for her?

09:49.250 --> 09:51.377
They're not a couple.

09:51.377 --> 09:54.173
That's all I can say for now.

09:54.173 --> 09:56.596
So you just...

09:56.596 --> 09:58.666
Like this...

09:58.666 --> 10:00.374
Actually, never mind.

10:00.374 --> 10:04.193
You're already handsome.

10:05.350 --> 10:07.954
Hey, the thing you like is on.

10:07.954 --> 10:10.531
Goodness.

10:10.531 --> 10:14.198
He says he handles three extra boxes a day.

10:14.198 --> 10:18.780
Nothing in this world is easy.

10:18.780 --> 10:21.521
It takes ten seconds
to prep one chicken foot...

10:21.521 --> 10:23.465
Let's watch something else.

10:23.465 --> 10:24.577
Why? I was watching that.

10:24.577 --> 10:26.746
Actress Son Jeong A is drawing attention

10:26.746 --> 10:29.069
over multiple allegations
of affairs and sponsor relationships.

10:29.069 --> 10:31.153
However, her agency

10:31.153 --> 10:33.571
[Dating a surgeon, a director, and a model?]
has made no official statement

10:33.571 --> 10:36.631
regarding these allegations.

10:36.631 --> 10:39.062
Look at that face.

10:39.062 --> 10:41.427
With a face like that,
why live such a shady life?

10:41.427 --> 10:43.463
Right?

10:45.628 --> 10:48.664
Have fun watching.

10:48.664 --> 10:51.396
- Why aren't you watching?
- I have a headache.

10:51.396 --> 10:54.929
- I think I'll go work out.
- Okay then.

10:55.608 --> 10:58.070
What's wrong with her?

11:08.097 --> 11:11.944
My gosh... he didn't wake up once.

11:12.723 --> 11:17.293
What is he, Sleeping Beauty?

11:17.293 --> 11:19.706
A prince?

11:25.575 --> 11:30.068
Actually, more like a servant.

11:35.064 --> 11:36.597
Hello, this is Deukgeun Deukgeun Gym.

11:36.597 --> 11:38.050
Just a laborer.

11:38.050 --> 11:40.263
You sound like you just woke up.

11:40.263 --> 11:41.586
Are you home?

11:41.586 --> 11:43.073
Yeah, I'm home.

11:43.073 --> 11:46.070
Why? I'm already in my shoes,
about to head to the gym.

11:46.070 --> 11:49.240
The AC broke, so we're closed until it's fixed.

11:49.240 --> 11:51.617
I sent a message out. Read it, will you?

11:51.617 --> 11:53.374
My head hurts today,

11:53.374 --> 11:56.044
so I thought I'd at least
move my body a little.

11:56.044 --> 11:57.851
Then go out and walk.

11:57.851 --> 12:00.712
Tighten your core,
and land your feet heel first.

12:00.712 --> 12:02.848
Hit 8,000 steps,

12:02.848 --> 12:04.685
- then send me a screenshot.
- He's working even in his sleep?

12:04.685 --> 12:07.138
Okay, get some rest.

12:07.138 --> 12:09.251
Alright.

12:10.845 --> 12:13.548
Okay, let's walk.

12:13.548 --> 12:17.167
The heavier your legs feel,
the lighter your head gets.

12:25.360 --> 12:27.063
How long are you going to sleep?

12:27.063 --> 12:29.388
Wasn't today your day off?

12:29.388 --> 12:32.143
Wasn't there anything you wanted to do?

12:32.143 --> 12:35.281
Well, I do need to go to the bank
and the post office.

12:39.361 --> 12:40.845
Oh, right.

12:40.845 --> 12:43.428
Since it's the weekend...

12:43.428 --> 12:45.994
maybe the laundromat?

12:49.639 --> 12:52.798
Not things you have to do.

12:52.798 --> 12:54.259
Something you want to do.

12:54.259 --> 12:58.488
How can someone live
only doing what they have to?

12:59.330 --> 13:02.007
Something cute and fun.

13:02.007 --> 13:05.407
Something I could do with you.

13:05.407 --> 13:07.724
Oh, something like that?

13:07.724 --> 13:09.964
Of course.

13:09.964 --> 13:14.455
I'd love to travel to a warm southern country.

13:14.455 --> 13:18.241
But unless we can teleport,
how are we supposed to go?

13:18.241 --> 13:21.814
You jumped borders pretty fast there.

13:21.814 --> 13:24.152
Hold on.

13:25.654 --> 13:29.024
Maybe we can't travel...

13:29.024 --> 13:34.631
but we can change the vibe here.

13:34.631 --> 13:36.459
Just like that.

13:36.459 --> 13:38.466
Warm... humid...

13:38.466 --> 13:42.144
and a little sticky.

13:44.331 --> 13:48.177
They're both actors,
so they could know each other.

13:49.378 --> 13:52.785
But that message was a little...

13:52.785 --> 13:54.752
There's something important
I need to talk about.

13:54.752 --> 13:56.699
I'm at The Hills Seoul. Come see me.

13:56.699 --> 13:59.899
This is bothering me.

14:04.453 --> 14:07.253
How did I end up here?

14:11.143 --> 14:13.229
Lee Ui Yeong?

14:13.229 --> 14:15.855
Hey, Lee Ui Yeong!

14:19.761 --> 14:22.174
Hi.

14:22.174 --> 14:23.611
What?

14:23.611 --> 14:25.911
- Did you come to see me?
- Me?

14:25.911 --> 14:27.731
You just saw me first.

14:27.731 --> 14:30.232
My trainer told me to walk 8,000 steps today,

14:30.232 --> 14:33.205
so I was just out walking.

14:33.205 --> 14:34.929
Well, since you're here,

14:34.929 --> 14:37.835
come grab a coffee.

15:00.874 --> 15:02.709
These are marked decaf.

15:02.709 --> 15:05.735
- Thank you.
- Thank you, enjoy.

15:13.040 --> 15:15.507
What?

15:15.507 --> 15:18.162
Are you pretending to read
while sneaking looks at me?

15:18.162 --> 15:19.947
Why are you still on the table of contents?

15:19.947 --> 15:22.191
You don't read, do you?

15:22.191 --> 15:24.908
You're supposed to read
the table of contents carefully.

15:24.908 --> 15:27.818
That's how you figure out
what the book's really about.

15:27.818 --> 15:30.278
Fair enough.

15:31.985 --> 15:33.868
I'm done with work now.

15:33.868 --> 15:36.345
- How many steps do you have left?
- Sorry?

15:36.345 --> 15:40.065
You said you had to hit 8,000 steps.

15:40.065 --> 15:43.138
I could use some fresh air too.

15:56.211 --> 15:58.522
Here.

16:04.128 --> 16:07.014
Why are you taking the stairs?

16:09.508 --> 16:12.332
The weather's nice.

16:12.332 --> 16:14.030
Though it might rain again.

16:14.030 --> 16:17.201
The weather's been unpredictable lately.

16:17.201 --> 16:20.408
What's bothering you?

16:20.408 --> 16:22.138
I don't know.

16:22.138 --> 16:26.281
I just feel a little restless
this time of year.

16:26.281 --> 16:29.150
And I usually ride my motorcycle everywhere.

16:29.150 --> 16:31.082
Thought maybe I wasn't getting enough exercise.

16:31.082 --> 16:32.412
You?

16:32.412 --> 16:35.472
Just working at that cafe
must be a few thousand steps a day.

16:35.472 --> 16:38.737
And acting takes a lot of energy too.

16:38.737 --> 16:41.776
If anyone's lacking exercise, it's me.

16:41.776 --> 16:42.859
Yeah?

16:42.859 --> 16:46.195
Then I guess I really will be now.

16:59.175 --> 17:01.473
I quit the theater company.

17:01.473 --> 17:03.027
Really?

17:03.027 --> 17:05.724
But a few days ago, you had a show...

17:05.724 --> 17:07.217
A show?

17:07.217 --> 17:12.438
You invited people
and told them to come see it.

17:12.438 --> 17:15.631
Yeah, I did.

17:16.458 --> 17:18.422
Why? Disappointed?

17:18.422 --> 17:20.627
Want me to perform just for you?

17:20.627 --> 17:22.797
What?
It's not like you're confessing or anything.

17:22.797 --> 17:24.333
Why would you do that for me?

17:24.333 --> 17:28.039
So, should I or not?

17:33.259 --> 17:36.036
Anyway, if you quit the company,

17:36.036 --> 17:37.781
what are you going to do about acting?

17:37.781 --> 17:39.086
I don't know.

17:39.086 --> 17:40.670
I'll figure something out.

17:40.670 --> 17:44.146
If nothing else, maybe I'll shave my head
and become a monk.

17:44.146 --> 17:47.139
Or... maybe I'll start dating.

17:49.486 --> 17:52.550
You must've given your parents a hard time
when you were younger.

17:52.550 --> 17:54.883
Well...

17:55.666 --> 17:58.433
But it's okay.

17:58.433 --> 18:00.584
There's no one left for me to worry now.

18:00.584 --> 18:02.248
Even if I quit the company,

18:02.248 --> 18:06.214
you're the only one who worries about me.

18:09.876 --> 18:12.969
8,000 steps is more than I thought.

18:12.969 --> 18:14.913
How many do you have left?

18:14.913 --> 18:17.137
If we want to hit it,
we better pick up the pace.

18:17.137 --> 18:19.326
Let's go.

18:25.056 --> 18:27.516
Open the door, please.

18:27.516 --> 18:29.729
Hey!

18:30.522 --> 18:32.622
Come in.

18:38.629 --> 18:41.747
You took a taxi.
Why are you sweating like that?

18:41.747 --> 18:44.440
The hallway's long.

18:47.101 --> 18:50.961
The headline came out strong.

18:50.961 --> 18:54.511
A bigger love story to bury the rumors.

18:54.511 --> 18:56.261
It's exactly what you wanted.

18:56.261 --> 18:57.681
Yeah.

18:57.681 --> 18:59.732
That reporter was a great writer.

18:59.732 --> 19:01.218
I almost took it to a film producer.

19:01.218 --> 19:02.053
[I've never tried to hide it,
I only wanted to protect it]

19:02.053 --> 19:04.242
But why not make it public?

19:04.242 --> 19:05.839
Dr. Shin wants to move fast.

19:05.839 --> 19:09.046
Everyone's just waiting for your approval.

19:09.046 --> 19:10.896
I like it.

19:10.896 --> 19:12.897
But someone else doesn't.

19:12.897 --> 19:14.758
He's practically begging me to leave him out.

19:14.758 --> 19:15.990
What am I supposed to do?

19:15.990 --> 19:17.860
What about you?

19:17.860 --> 19:20.493
Are you not going to work for a while?

19:20.493 --> 19:23.797
Just until things quiet down.

19:23.797 --> 19:27.027
Once another scandal breaks,
people will forget about me.

19:27.027 --> 19:28.437
Beats me...

19:28.437 --> 19:30.551
You get everyone worked up,

19:30.551 --> 19:34.057
then cool it all down.

19:35.127 --> 19:36.879
Anyway,

19:36.879 --> 19:38.916
there's something I need to sort out
while I'm taking a break.

19:38.916 --> 19:40.941
Lee Yoon Jeong...

19:40.941 --> 19:43.298
Find out if she had her surgery
at Dr. Shin's hospital.

19:43.298 --> 19:45.120
Look into it carefully.

19:45.120 --> 19:49.277
Good afternoon, ladies and gentlemen.

19:49.277 --> 19:53.417
This is Captain Jung speaking.

19:53.417 --> 19:57.194
Hyun Min, I bought everything you asked for.

19:57.194 --> 20:01.454
Welcome aboard Hyun Min Airlines.

20:17.933 --> 20:20.063
How am I supposed to wear this?

20:20.063 --> 20:23.049
- It's cute.
- Really?

20:24.807 --> 20:26.999
Come on.

20:29.140 --> 20:31.559
Desert island! Come on, come on!

20:31.559 --> 20:33.185
One, two, three, four, five!

20:33.185 --> 20:36.481
Okay, Singapore!

20:38.763 --> 20:40.773
- Cheers.
- Cheers!

20:58.334 --> 21:00.574
You know,

21:00.574 --> 21:03.491
I didn't expect
makeshift vacation to be this nice.

21:03.491 --> 21:06.751
The ocean and the sunset are all fake,

21:06.751 --> 21:07.895
so why am I enjoying this?

21:07.895 --> 21:09.435
Why do you think?

21:09.435 --> 21:11.426
Because I'm here with you.

21:11.426 --> 21:14.205
If you do this alone, it's just sad.

21:14.205 --> 21:15.936
But together...

21:15.936 --> 21:17.194
it's romantic.

21:17.194 --> 21:20.362
It's just one of those things.

21:21.978 --> 21:23.841
Romantic.

21:23.841 --> 21:26.815
So romantic.

21:26.815 --> 21:29.202
Romantic...

21:29.202 --> 21:32.755
It's been a while since I've felt that.

21:33.806 --> 21:37.936
Still, I have to go to the laundromat tomorrow.

21:37.936 --> 21:40.909
I can't wash blankets at home.

21:42.589 --> 21:44.767
You can't just do whatever you want.

21:44.767 --> 21:47.333
Sometimes you still have to do
what you have to do.

21:47.333 --> 21:51.800
But I'll do the laundry tomorrow.

21:51.800 --> 21:53.936
Tomorrow?

22:03.432 --> 22:06.665
[Pop-up Closing Notice]

22:37.847 --> 22:40.639
Well, the thing is...

22:40.639 --> 22:45.609
Ms. Sae Byeok, you've worked really hard,
and I know that.

22:45.609 --> 22:48.144
But it's going to be difficult
to convert you to a full-time position.

22:48.144 --> 22:50.584
Since the internship period is limited,

22:50.584 --> 22:52.609
mistakes tend to stand out more.

22:52.609 --> 22:55.059
That's just how it is, you know?

22:55.059 --> 22:59.311
Learning to take it in stride
is part of working life too.

23:00.061 --> 23:01.099
Yes.

23:01.099 --> 23:04.026
Of all people, I had to be the one
delivering this news.

23:04.026 --> 23:06.841
I don't feel great about it either.

23:06.841 --> 23:08.657
I'm sorry.

23:08.657 --> 23:11.315
Come on, don't say that.

23:11.315 --> 23:13.248
That's all.

23:14.061 --> 23:17.798
You're not being asked to leave right away.

23:21.152 --> 23:22.862
- Oh, hey.
- Hello.

23:22.862 --> 23:24.423
- Mr. Ahn.
- Long time no see.

23:24.423 --> 23:28.012
- How have you been?
- Same as always.

23:28.012 --> 23:29.369
By the way,

23:29.369 --> 23:31.803
I heard Attorney Kang
is transferring out of your team.

23:31.803 --> 23:33.921
Man, that's rough.
Losing someone that talented.

23:33.921 --> 23:36.145
- No...
- He's going to a law firm.

23:36.145 --> 23:37.805
He was joking that
if it gets too tough over there,

23:37.805 --> 23:38.936
he'll come crawling back.

23:38.936 --> 23:42.518
So I told him we don't take back traitors.

23:42.518 --> 23:44.959
He's just chasing the money.

23:44.959 --> 23:47.920
- How about a coffee?
- Sure.

23:54.388 --> 23:55.665
[Closed for weekend AC repairs]

23:57.988 --> 24:00.981
Money works wonders.

24:02.227 --> 24:04.205
Did you go somewhere nice?

24:04.205 --> 24:05.778
You look really refreshed.

24:07.650 --> 24:09.695
Do you have to go somewhere
for it to count as a vacation?

24:09.695 --> 24:12.695
If your mind's at ease, that's a vacation.

24:12.695 --> 24:15.965
When the members come in today,
don't forget to renew their memberships.

24:15.965 --> 24:18.011
Yes.

24:24.753 --> 24:25.923
You at work?

24:25.923 --> 24:29.666
I might be a little dizzy from the jet lag.

24:29.666 --> 24:31.036
Just kidding.

24:31.036 --> 24:33.399
Have a great day.

24:33.399 --> 24:35.853
So cheesy.

24:35.853 --> 24:39.108
Hyun Min, they're taking down
the lobby pop-up now, right?

24:39.108 --> 24:40.158
Yes.

24:40.158 --> 24:44.047
The marketing team is pulling out
the items to send back to the brand first.

24:44.770 --> 24:47.993
The HOME staff should be here soon too.

24:48.941 --> 24:51.662
[Purchasing Team - Intern Sim Sae Byeok
Internship Completion Notice]

24:54.822 --> 24:56.431
[Please be advised that the internship of
Purchasing Team intern]

24:56.431 --> 24:58.802
[Sim Sae Byeok has concluded as of
Thursday, August 7, 2025]

25:01.233 --> 25:04.934
Come to think of it,
she hasn't been at her desk for a while.

25:04.934 --> 25:07.941
Maybe she already heard?

25:08.622 --> 25:10.699
Let's not look for her right now.

25:10.699 --> 25:14.688
She probably needs some time
to pull herself together.

25:15.353 --> 25:17.566
Okay.

25:38.699 --> 25:41.745
Perfect day to tear this down.

25:42.749 --> 25:44.440
You're here.

25:44.440 --> 25:48.262
- Oh, hello.
- Hello.

25:48.262 --> 25:50.155
Long time no see.

25:50.155 --> 25:51.552
Oh, yes.

25:51.552 --> 25:54.478
It's been a while.

25:55.484 --> 25:56.929
Alright, shall we start?

25:56.929 --> 25:59.136
- Yes.
- Let's go, let's go.

25:59.136 --> 26:00.643
Thanks for your hard work.

26:00.643 --> 26:03.158
Hang in there.

26:06.733 --> 26:10.139
[Under Construction]

26:16.069 --> 26:17.821
Hold it up.

26:17.821 --> 26:19.992
One, two, three.

26:27.486 --> 26:30.286
I think we're good to proceed.

26:33.144 --> 26:34.824
Ms. Ui Yeong?

26:34.824 --> 26:37.230
Oh, sorry.

26:37.230 --> 26:40.969
I sent this by email earlier,
but this is the soban order form.

26:40.969 --> 26:42.685
I thought it might be easier
to check while you're working.

26:42.685 --> 26:43.770
Thanks.

26:43.770 --> 26:47.056
But is something wrong?

26:48.041 --> 26:49.498
Oh, our intern...

26:49.498 --> 26:52.356
She won't be working with us anymore.

26:52.356 --> 26:55.046
So I keep wondering if she's doing okay.

26:55.046 --> 26:56.252
Really?

26:56.252 --> 26:58.605
I had a good impression of her.
She seemed very diligent.

26:58.605 --> 27:00.855
Exactly. She's really kind and passionate.

27:00.855 --> 27:05.415
But after she made that mistake,
it seems like she lost a lot of confidence.

27:17.115 --> 27:18.645
Ms. Sae Byeok.

27:18.645 --> 27:20.714
Yes?

27:23.540 --> 27:24.971
When you use tools,

27:24.971 --> 27:27.402
instead of relying only on your wrist or arm,

27:27.402 --> 27:29.987
- it's better to use your body weight.
- Oh, okay.

27:29.987 --> 27:32.350
Here, this might help.

27:32.350 --> 27:36.696
You want me to do it?

27:37.775 --> 27:39.432
Let me give you one more tip.

27:39.432 --> 27:42.343
When you put force into it,
put a little attitude into it too.

27:42.343 --> 27:46.120
Think about the faces
of people who made your job harder.

27:46.120 --> 27:47.453
Okay.

27:59.913 --> 28:02.222
Ui Yeong, because of you,

28:03.343 --> 28:06.339
Sae Byeok feels uncomfortable around me.

28:11.184 --> 28:14.229
They're only asking to review it
because of you.

28:14.229 --> 28:16.962
Let's not make things complicated.

28:20.611 --> 28:23.532
Of all people, I had to be the one
delivering this news.

28:23.532 --> 28:26.246
I don't feel great about it either.

28:34.436 --> 28:36.507
I feel like a giant dust ball.

28:36.507 --> 28:39.284
We've been here for years
and we're doing demolition now?

28:39.284 --> 28:42.200
Hey, even the executives pitch in.

28:42.200 --> 28:44.270
It'd be nice if we got a new junior soon.

28:44.270 --> 28:46.408
- Right, Yu Been?
- Yes.

28:46.408 --> 28:48.145
You know, even at senior centers,

28:48.145 --> 28:51.670
the youngest seventy-year-old
still does the grunt work.

28:51.670 --> 28:55.256
By the way, who's been working so hard?

29:07.814 --> 29:10.370
Sir, should we order dinner?

29:11.064 --> 29:13.464
If I eat now, I might get too sleepy.

29:13.464 --> 29:16.157
Oh, then...

29:18.077 --> 29:19.670
Try this first.

29:19.670 --> 29:21.713
There's nothing better
when you need to stay awake.

29:21.713 --> 29:23.671
Just keep it in your drawer
and have one when you need it.

29:23.671 --> 29:26.051
Thanks.

29:26.051 --> 29:28.450
Why don't you guys hit the sauna,
wash up, and grab something to eat?

29:28.450 --> 29:30.284
I'll check the order forms here.

29:30.284 --> 29:33.257
- And on your way back...
- Anything for you, huh?

29:33.257 --> 29:35.343
Yeah.

29:41.200 --> 29:42.224
[Customer Order Form]

29:42.224 --> 29:44.864
Hang in there.
Make sure you eat well while you work.

29:44.864 --> 29:46.034
Wait a second.

29:46.034 --> 29:48.294
Actually, not just anything.

29:48.294 --> 29:50.554
Bring something good.

29:50.554 --> 29:53.098
Yes, sir. Something good.

29:53.098 --> 29:54.448
Okay, something good.

29:54.448 --> 29:55.988
What does he even like?

29:55.988 --> 29:58.805
No idea. Just something good.

30:12.716 --> 30:14.288
Tastes good.

30:18.673 --> 30:21.496
Cut the crap with your oversized ego already.

30:21.496 --> 30:23.150
The place you treat like some bunker to hide in

30:23.150 --> 30:26.196
is the stage we've been dying to stand on.

30:44.671 --> 30:45.338
[Son Jeong A's love story revealed!]

30:45.338 --> 30:47.992
[Marriage registered with
a renowned university hospital professor]

31:03.899 --> 31:05.743
Since when have you been sponsoring
our theater company?

31:05.743 --> 31:07.620
How did you know I was even there?

31:07.620 --> 31:09.969
I was doing just fine on my own.

31:09.969 --> 31:11.840
Why make me look like someone who needs money?

31:11.840 --> 31:14.726
Come in. Let's talk inside.

31:34.417 --> 31:35.581
Check the article.

31:35.581 --> 31:39.280
For now, only close associates are allowed
into actress Son's room.

31:39.280 --> 31:41.342
[Son Jeong A's love story revealed]

31:44.858 --> 31:47.420
[Rumors of sponsored meetings
and secret affairs denied]

31:58.745 --> 32:01.668
[Son Jeong A]

32:01.668 --> 32:04.271
[Profile: Son Jeong A]

32:06.175 --> 32:09.317
[Did actor C get opportunities
thanks to Son Jeong A?]

32:10.292 --> 32:14.492
How many articles are there?

32:15.940 --> 32:17.965
Wait... then...

32:17.965 --> 32:21.405
Shin Ji Su is her stepson?

32:23.165 --> 32:25.522
But Ji Su said

32:25.522 --> 32:29.535
there was no parent left to worry about him.

32:34.175 --> 32:36.252
How does she hide a marriage for years?

32:36.252 --> 32:39.830
Come on, I heard the man was widowed
and then remarried.

32:39.830 --> 32:41.778
She was probably being careful.

32:41.778 --> 32:43.495
Once you've got a family to think about,

32:43.495 --> 32:46.721
you learn to keep your mouth shut. Like me.

32:47.368 --> 32:48.725
But is it true?

32:48.725 --> 32:52.005
That cafe part-timer
at the place we always go to.

32:52.005 --> 32:54.289
I saw his whole life got dug up online.

32:54.289 --> 32:56.657
It's not like he got exposed
over something bad.

32:56.657 --> 32:58.548
People were all saying how lucky he is,

32:58.548 --> 33:00.932
with a doctor for a dad
and a famous actress for a mom.

33:00.932 --> 33:05.105
Yeah, I knew it the second I saw him.

33:13.361 --> 33:15.843
[This is reporter Kim Jung Hyun
with Osori News]

33:15.843 --> 33:18.265
[Lee Min Ji: You're on TV]
[Kim Da Eun: What is this?]

33:18.265 --> 33:21.144
Of all days...

33:32.210 --> 33:34.234
- This is the place, right?
- Yeah, it is.

33:34.234 --> 33:37.300
- What if he ran off?
- Then what time is he coming?

33:42.056 --> 33:45.580
The person you're trying to reach
has turned off their phone.

33:45.580 --> 33:47.685
You will be connected to voicemail...

33:47.685 --> 33:50.765
Why is his phone off?

33:53.697 --> 33:55.240
Where are you?

33:55.240 --> 33:58.470
Call me when you see this.

33:59.783 --> 34:03.372
[Where every journey begins]

34:25.613 --> 34:27.900
Ui Yeong,

34:27.900 --> 34:30.398
today is Sae Byeok's last day.

34:30.398 --> 34:33.378
Want to grab a drink after work?

34:34.084 --> 34:36.653
I'm sorry, but I've got something today.

34:36.653 --> 34:38.506
Let's do a proper farewell another time, okay?

34:38.506 --> 34:41.355
I should get going. Sorry.

34:41.355 --> 34:42.867
Ui Yeong!

34:42.867 --> 34:44.288
See you tomorrow.

34:49.854 --> 34:51.158
Hello, sir.

34:51.158 --> 34:52.705
Oh, Ui Yeong.

34:52.705 --> 34:55.505
Did Ji Su not come in today?

35:05.139 --> 35:07.134
[Meru Arts Center]

35:07.134 --> 35:10.223
I'm perfectly willing to get treated,

35:10.223 --> 35:13.113
but this doctor here says no!

35:13.113 --> 35:14.510
You're sixty years old.

35:14.510 --> 35:17.116
What treatment are you even talking about?

35:17.116 --> 35:21.378
So what if I'm sixty? I still want to live!

35:21.378 --> 35:23.110
Excuse me.

35:23.110 --> 35:25.194
What's the reason for your visit?

35:25.194 --> 35:27.061
Oh, hello.

35:27.061 --> 35:30.440
I'm a friend of Ji Su's.

35:32.992 --> 35:35.135
He isn't here.

35:35.135 --> 35:37.055
He quit the company.

35:37.055 --> 35:38.826
I know that, but...

35:38.826 --> 35:40.857
Do you happen to know where he lives,

35:40.857 --> 35:45.162
or maybe a restaurant or PC cafe
he used to go to a lot?

35:45.162 --> 35:48.082
He's missing now.

35:48.082 --> 35:51.788
He didn't show up at the cafe,
and no one can reach him.

35:51.788 --> 35:54.522
Maybe he just got fed up with everything
and went off the grid.

35:54.522 --> 35:56.858
I know where he lives,
so let's check there first...

35:56.858 --> 35:59.369
Wait. What's today's date?

35:59.369 --> 36:02.349
It's the seventh.

36:04.955 --> 36:07.968
Then he didn't just disappear.

36:15.960 --> 36:20.329
[The late Lee Yoon Jeong]

36:24.987 --> 36:27.353
Mom.

36:30.207 --> 36:33.633
Your son's here, Mom.

36:35.141 --> 36:40.160
I said I'd come by more often,
but here I am again only on the day you left.

36:41.804 --> 36:46.176
It's not that I forgot.
I've just been busy trying to get by.

36:46.176 --> 36:47.781
Look.

36:47.781 --> 36:51.557
I brought a ton of the coffee you like.

36:58.576 --> 37:01.944
After your surgery,

37:01.944 --> 37:05.836
I wouldn't let you drink coffee anymore.

37:08.985 --> 37:11.765
I kind of regret that.

37:11.765 --> 37:14.990
When you said you wanted some,
I should've just let you have it.

37:14.990 --> 37:18.763
Maybe it would've helped
you feel a little better.

37:21.072 --> 37:23.739
You know...

37:24.765 --> 37:28.559
I just want to have a cup of coffee
with you, Mom.

37:29.968 --> 37:33.244
Sit in a sunny cafe,

37:33.244 --> 37:35.664
talk about people,

37:37.333 --> 37:40.464
talk about life.

37:45.216 --> 37:47.760
If I quit the theater,
what are they supposed to do without me?

37:47.760 --> 37:49.576
Who's going to run errands
and do all the cleaning?

37:49.576 --> 37:52.756
And honestly, they all look like potatoes.

37:56.394 --> 37:57.680
Mom, try this coffee.

37:57.680 --> 38:00.340
I made it.

38:53.076 --> 38:56.652
What? How did you know?

38:56.652 --> 39:00.542
I told you the weather's been unpredictable.

39:00.542 --> 39:03.002
I figured you probably
didn't bring an umbrella.

39:03.002 --> 39:07.593
How did you know it was my mom's memorial day?

39:11.818 --> 39:13.958
Hang on.

39:44.290 --> 39:46.170
What if

39:46.170 --> 39:49.623
my mom gets the wrong idea
about us if you come here?

39:49.623 --> 39:51.647
Can you handle that?

39:51.647 --> 39:54.736
She's very conservative.

39:57.021 --> 40:00.972
She'll probably just think
I'm a friend who cares about you.

40:00.972 --> 40:02.558
Do you

40:02.558 --> 40:05.454
worry about me that much?

40:05.454 --> 40:07.971
You took me to the hospital,

40:07.971 --> 40:11.178
and gave me rides on your motorcycle.

40:11.178 --> 40:13.948
You show up right when I'm vulnerable

40:13.948 --> 40:17.079
and completely throw me off.

40:19.410 --> 40:21.997
And...

40:23.082 --> 40:26.738
I'm not the only one who was worried about you.

40:26.738 --> 40:30.548
That stupid article came out
on his mom's memorial day.

40:30.548 --> 40:33.252
He's probably off somewhere
feeling miserable all by himself again.

40:33.252 --> 40:35.678
Who wrote that article? Report it.

40:35.678 --> 40:37.700
Oh, found it.

40:37.700 --> 40:39.436
Haneulbal Memorial Park.

40:39.436 --> 40:42.727
Right, that's it. I went with him last year.

40:42.727 --> 40:45.211
Shouldn't we go now?

40:45.211 --> 40:48.890
He may have quit the theater company,
but we're still his only real friends.

40:48.890 --> 40:51.160
We should at least go have a drink with him.

40:51.160 --> 40:53.811
Then let's go. Cancel today's rehearsal.

40:53.811 --> 40:57.860
No, it's okay. I'll go.

41:08.887 --> 41:09.991
Ms. Ui Yeong,

41:09.991 --> 41:13.118
the wood for the soban came in today,
so I'm going to cut it before I leave.

41:13.118 --> 41:16.331
What are you up to? Are you off work yet?

41:18.364 --> 41:20.129
Hey, it's raining.

41:20.129 --> 41:21.735
Did you bring today's lumber inside?

41:22.819 --> 41:25.289
- It's still in the truck.
- Hey.

41:25.289 --> 41:26.981
Didn't you check the weather?

41:26.981 --> 41:29.005
Can't you do your job right?

41:29.005 --> 41:31.269
Darn it.

41:32.385 --> 41:35.044
Cover it up, now! Hurry!

41:35.044 --> 41:36.504
Hey!

41:36.504 --> 41:39.117
Move it! Come on!

41:39.117 --> 41:41.205
Hurry up, hurry!

41:45.455 --> 41:48.000
- Jin Su!
- Jin Su!

41:48.000 --> 41:49.972
Are you okay?

41:49.972 --> 41:52.794
Call 119, now!

41:57.051 --> 41:59.431
Jin Su, are you okay?

41:59.431 --> 42:02.172
Why were you still at work?

42:02.172 --> 42:05.184
That fall could've injured his spine.

42:05.184 --> 42:08.953
The doctor said it's a miracle
he only broke his arm.

42:08.953 --> 42:11.097
You don't need to come.

42:11.097 --> 42:13.843
Oh, he's coming.

42:14.472 --> 42:16.790
- How are you feeling?
- I'm sorry.

42:16.790 --> 42:18.620
You always told me to be careful.

42:18.620 --> 42:20.740
We're the ones who should be sorry.

42:20.740 --> 42:22.591
We have to reorder the lumber now too, right?

42:22.591 --> 42:24.384
Gosh, we're already short-handed...

42:24.384 --> 42:25.768
Hey, are you the boss?

42:25.768 --> 42:27.954
Why are you worrying about that?

42:27.954 --> 42:29.932
I'll take responsibility
and deal with it myself.

42:29.932 --> 42:31.484
You just focus on getting treated.

42:31.484 --> 42:34.874
And nothing matters more than safety.

42:34.874 --> 42:36.671
- Remember that.
- Yes, sir.

42:36.671 --> 42:37.738
Hey.

42:37.738 --> 42:40.471
Did it hurt a lot? You little punk...

42:40.471 --> 42:44.224
Even with a cut on your face,
you're still handsome.

42:49.157 --> 42:51.533
[Son Jeong A's love story revealed]
She is amazing.

42:51.533 --> 42:55.080
[Facing every controversy head-on]
I know, I could never do that.

42:55.080 --> 42:57.138
I'm even more of a fan now.

42:57.138 --> 42:58.983
She's so cool.

42:58.983 --> 43:01.673
Seriously, so cool.

43:06.585 --> 43:09.018
Ji Su.

43:09.018 --> 43:11.825
About that tabloid article...

43:11.825 --> 43:13.815
I knew it was about you.

43:13.815 --> 43:16.048
What?

43:17.134 --> 43:19.238
I don't know everything,

43:19.238 --> 43:22.684
but instead of trying so hard to avoid it,

43:22.684 --> 43:26.531
I hope you use that time and that energy

43:26.531 --> 43:29.341
to protect what you love.

43:29.341 --> 43:32.448
There must be something you care about too.

43:32.448 --> 43:36.734
A day, a month, and then a year.

43:36.734 --> 43:39.034
If you keep going like that,

43:39.034 --> 43:41.134
I'm sure there'll come a time

43:41.134 --> 43:44.681
when even this won't hurt so much anymore.

43:59.507 --> 44:01.696
Don't turn off your phone again.

44:01.696 --> 44:03.302
Okay.

44:03.302 --> 44:05.590
Thanks for today.

44:05.590 --> 44:07.014
And...

44:07.014 --> 44:10.296
If there's anything
you need my help with, call me.

44:10.296 --> 44:12.523
Okay.

44:18.404 --> 44:20.408
Anyone who makes it through something like this

44:20.408 --> 44:22.954
becomes unstoppable.

44:22.954 --> 44:25.178
Wasn't Dr. Shin already the leading candidate

44:25.178 --> 44:27.454
even before the tabloid piece?

44:27.454 --> 44:30.525
Even so, this isn't something
we should decide like this.

44:30.525 --> 44:32.535
Though this may be hard for you to hear,

44:32.535 --> 44:35.674
but the momentum has shifted
heavily toward Dr. Shin.

44:35.674 --> 44:40.700
The VIP patients are already insisting
they want Dr. Shin as their doctor.

44:42.748 --> 44:45.065
Sorry, I was tied up in a joint consultation.

44:45.065 --> 44:46.871
Looks like you all started without me.

44:46.871 --> 44:49.895
Well, look who's here.
Our hospital's greatest romantic.

44:49.895 --> 44:52.281
Have a seat.

45:04.479 --> 45:07.086
- We'll review it.
- Okay.

45:07.086 --> 45:10.706
We also have to consider
the hospital's image, sir.

45:22.714 --> 45:27.148
[Son Jeong A]
[Reporter Yoon of Spotlight]

45:32.504 --> 45:36.140
[Reporter Yoon of Spotlight]

45:40.150 --> 45:42.595
Hello, this is Shin Ji Hoon.

45:42.595 --> 45:45.502
I read the article.

45:45.502 --> 45:47.015
Seems like...

45:47.015 --> 45:51.475
the people around me
were even more impressed than I was.

46:06.181 --> 46:08.637
Can I help you with something?

46:08.637 --> 46:10.657
No, it's nothing.

46:10.657 --> 46:12.034
Oh, right.

46:12.034 --> 46:13.974
You know that woman from before,

46:13.974 --> 46:16.578
the one who dragged in that huge cooler?

46:16.578 --> 46:18.182
- Yeah.
- Is she a member here?

46:18.182 --> 46:20.591
No, she's my gi...

46:21.191 --> 46:23.844
I mean, why do you ask?

46:23.844 --> 46:25.194
She looked familiar.

46:25.194 --> 46:28.029
I was trying to remember
where I'd seen her before, and then it hit me.

46:28.029 --> 46:29.542
From the app.

46:29.542 --> 46:31.281
She's someone I matched with on the app.

46:31.281 --> 46:33.932
A fated reunion.

46:33.932 --> 46:36.330
You must be mistaken.

46:36.330 --> 46:37.950
No, it's definitely her.

46:37.950 --> 46:39.780
She has pretty big feet.

46:39.780 --> 46:42.202
Her feet? How would you even know that?

46:42.202 --> 46:44.140
And, see.

46:44.140 --> 46:46.882
She once told me my forearms were cute.

46:46.882 --> 46:50.219
When someone compliments you
like that, you remember it.

46:50.219 --> 46:52.949
How am I supposed to wear this?

46:52.949 --> 46:54.986
- It's cute.
- Really?

46:54.986 --> 46:57.659
Man, I'd really love to see her again.

46:57.659 --> 46:59.805
So she's not a member here?

46:59.805 --> 47:01.561
No, she isn't.

47:01.561 --> 47:04.286
- Got it.
- Yeah.

47:08.961 --> 47:10.453
- Come again.
- Thank you.

47:10.453 --> 47:13.078
Yeah.

47:13.078 --> 47:15.804
I'm sorry for missing work without notice.

47:15.804 --> 47:18.748
The day that article came out
was my mom's memorial day.

47:18.748 --> 47:20.217
Then I saw the reporters and kind of panicked.

47:20.217 --> 47:23.664
I had no idea people were seeing you that way.

47:23.664 --> 47:25.828
Did things get sorted out at all?

47:25.828 --> 47:28.090
Well...

47:28.090 --> 47:29.875
Not really.

47:29.875 --> 47:31.394
But I need this job.

47:31.394 --> 47:33.959
I know I'm asking a lot,
but if you can give me one more chance,

47:33.959 --> 47:35.749
I'll work really hard.

47:35.749 --> 47:37.073
Next time,

47:37.073 --> 47:39.659
let me know in advance.

47:40.713 --> 47:43.045
Thank you.

47:55.409 --> 47:57.782
Give it to me. I'll clear it.

47:57.782 --> 48:00.275
Thank you.

48:12.032 --> 48:15.106
Why hasn't she come by for coffee?

48:15.106 --> 48:18.372
She's not going somewhere else, is she?

48:18.372 --> 48:20.685
Welcome.

48:27.197 --> 48:30.411
There's something I don't know what to do with.

48:31.263 --> 48:33.776
What is it?

48:39.495 --> 48:41.140
Why did you keep this
instead of throwing it out?

48:41.140 --> 48:44.566
It's got personal info on it,
so I couldn't just toss it.

48:44.566 --> 48:47.093
This one just came in,

48:47.093 --> 48:48.317
and the audition's soon.

48:48.317 --> 48:49.534
[Kim Ji Yoon]

48:49.534 --> 48:50.861
What?

48:50.861 --> 48:54.794
- You want me to audition?
- You've got nowhere left to hide now.

48:54.794 --> 48:57.451
How does it feel
being known as Son Jeong A's son?

48:57.451 --> 48:58.931
What kind of question is that?

48:58.931 --> 48:59.976
It's the worst.

48:59.976 --> 49:01.281
Then get famous.

49:01.281 --> 49:04.334
Make Son Jeong A known as your mom.

49:04.334 --> 49:07.146
I don't want to be tied to that woman
as somebody's son

49:07.146 --> 49:08.395
or somebody's mom.

49:08.395 --> 49:09.493
Then change your name.

49:09.493 --> 49:12.037
My name's Yong Min, so maybe Yong Seon?

49:12.037 --> 49:13.666
Gosh.

49:13.666 --> 49:15.406
That's so childish.

49:15.406 --> 49:18.992
- How do you make it sound that simple?
- Because it's not my problem.

49:20.002 --> 49:22.459
What's going on between you
and that girl from before?

49:22.459 --> 49:24.875
Who?

49:25.972 --> 49:27.642
- Lee Ui Yeong?
- Yeah.

49:27.642 --> 49:29.465
She...

49:29.465 --> 49:31.689
She's just worried about me.

49:31.689 --> 49:34.598
There's someone else
things are going well with.

49:34.598 --> 49:37.023
He's about this tall,

49:37.023 --> 49:38.343
and he's some company CEO.

49:38.343 --> 49:40.193
You like her, don't you?

49:40.193 --> 49:41.837
Pity is a feeling too.

49:41.837 --> 49:46.321
And if you really go for it,
what's stopping you?

49:48.230 --> 49:50.182
[Kim Ji Yoon]

49:55.112 --> 49:57.156
Sorry, something came up with the schedule,

49:57.156 --> 50:00.159
so I changed the location.

50:00.159 --> 50:04.395
Then... why did you want to see me?

50:04.395 --> 50:07.855
How was it working at the hotel this time?

50:08.709 --> 50:13.099
I really enjoyed the work,
and the seniors were all so nice to me.

50:13.099 --> 50:15.423
So that's why it feels even more disappointing.

50:15.423 --> 50:16.647
- I see.
- Yeah.

50:16.647 --> 50:19.273
- Have a seat.
- Thanks.

50:26.370 --> 50:29.341
And, well... as you know,

50:29.341 --> 50:32.399
I think I kind of messed up
in all sorts of ways.

50:32.399 --> 50:33.984
In our line of work,

50:33.984 --> 50:36.001
sometimes it matters to break things
and mess them up right.

50:36.001 --> 50:40.045
If you're not set on only hotels or purchasing,

50:40.045 --> 50:42.515
would you want to try working at our company?

50:42.515 --> 50:43.759
What?

50:43.759 --> 50:46.328
Hey.

50:46.328 --> 50:49.645
You're not supposed to talk loudly
in the library.

50:49.645 --> 50:53.478
Oh, sorry, Sua.

50:59.581 --> 51:01.881
Thanks.

51:12.516 --> 51:15.452
I didn't major in anything related to that,

51:15.452 --> 51:19.332
and that kind of work
would be completely new to me.

51:22.783 --> 51:25.411
From what I saw, you've got good instincts.

51:25.411 --> 51:27.398
There aren't many majors in our company either.

51:27.398 --> 51:29.535
Philosophy, early childhood education...

51:29.535 --> 51:31.379
That's what makes it more interesting.

51:31.379 --> 51:34.919
This place is the result of that too.

51:53.541 --> 51:55.665
I want to do it.

51:55.665 --> 51:58.465
I want to give it a try.

52:01.925 --> 52:04.823
When could you start?
The sooner, the better for us.

52:04.823 --> 52:07.423
If sooner is better,
then I could start right now.

52:07.423 --> 52:09.619
- Right now?
- Yes.

52:09.619 --> 52:11.756
We haven't signed anything yet, so...

52:11.756 --> 52:13.162
Then how about this?

52:13.162 --> 52:16.189
Think of today as a chance
to look through our company portfolio.

52:16.189 --> 52:18.926
At least you'll get a sense of
the kind of work we do.

52:18.926 --> 52:20.403
Sounds good.

52:20.403 --> 52:22.432
Okay.

52:24.848 --> 52:27.195
All this moving around...

52:32.044 --> 52:34.844
Should we go sit down?

52:36.391 --> 52:38.637
Is it good?

52:42.346 --> 52:45.566
- That too?
- Yeah, all of it.

52:47.684 --> 52:49.789
Every single piece of wood in here,

52:49.789 --> 52:52.915
there's not one spot we didn't have a hand in.

53:03.796 --> 53:05.533
Sir,

53:05.533 --> 53:08.979
- could you pack this up for us?
- Sure.

53:15.509 --> 53:17.260
Lee Ui Yeong, this is an emergency.

53:17.260 --> 53:19.997
- Are you free tonight?
- An emergency?

53:19.997 --> 53:22.710
What's wrong with him?

53:30.911 --> 53:32.189
What are you up to?

53:32.189 --> 53:35.478
Can I come hang out after work?

53:41.746 --> 53:45.066
Why isn't he replying?

53:50.330 --> 53:53.909
Hi, I think the reservation's under Shin Ji Su.

53:59.546 --> 54:02.279
Watch your step on the stairs.

54:11.887 --> 54:13.265
Right this way.

54:13.265 --> 54:16.425
- Enjoy your evening.
- Thank you.

54:36.124 --> 54:37.600
Hello,

54:37.600 --> 54:40.260
I'm Shin Ji Su.

54:41.956 --> 54:43.413
Nice place, right?

54:43.413 --> 54:46.116
I looked hard for somewhere with a good vibe

54:46.116 --> 54:48.051
since I was meeting you.

54:48.051 --> 54:51.517
What are you doing right now?

54:51.517 --> 54:53.354
Doesn't this feel like a blind date?

54:53.354 --> 54:55.874
If today were the first time we met,

54:55.874 --> 54:59.412
do you think you'd fall for me?

54:59.412 --> 55:01.036
Is this really the time for that?

55:01.036 --> 55:02.716
You said it was an emergency.

55:02.716 --> 55:04.086
I rushed over here.

55:04.086 --> 55:05.820
It is an emergency.

55:05.820 --> 55:08.240
A hunger emergency.

55:08.240 --> 55:11.473
You haven't had dinner, huh?

55:11.473 --> 55:14.366
No, I haven't, but...

55:14.366 --> 55:17.155
Hey, this place looks really expensive.

55:17.155 --> 55:19.468
It's fine. Pick whatever you want.

55:19.468 --> 55:21.232
I'm grateful to you,

55:21.232 --> 55:24.874
and I wanted to treat you to something good.

55:30.084 --> 55:32.895
Why is the soup so expensive?

55:38.003 --> 55:42.149
Then I'll have the tomato pasta.

55:46.751 --> 55:49.177
Excuse me.

55:51.510 --> 55:53.108
Are you ready to order?

55:53.108 --> 55:55.388
- Yes, we'll have this salad,
- Yes.

55:55.388 --> 55:57.272
the tomato pasta,

55:57.272 --> 55:59.889
- and the octopus and sirloin steak.
- Okay.

55:59.889 --> 56:03.329
- Want some wine?
- Well, yeah.

56:06.608 --> 56:08.057
We'll take a bottle of this.

56:08.057 --> 56:10.150
Okay. Is there anything else you need?

56:10.150 --> 56:12.316
No, that's all.

56:22.997 --> 56:24.746
Here.

56:24.746 --> 56:27.036
Thanks.

56:41.926 --> 56:45.312
I thought about you a lot.

56:46.279 --> 56:48.303
I felt like, at least with you,

56:48.303 --> 56:52.807
I should be honest about everything.

56:52.807 --> 56:54.545
And once I made up my mind,

56:54.545 --> 56:57.753
I didn't want to drag it out.

56:58.689 --> 57:00.726
After that article came out,

57:00.726 --> 57:02.483
people kept saying things to me.

57:02.483 --> 57:04.460
That I was lucky to be born into that family.

57:04.460 --> 57:07.246
That my dad's a doctor, so...

57:07.246 --> 57:10.030
But my dad's a doctor,

57:10.030 --> 57:12.436
and my mom...

57:13.757 --> 57:16.557
died of cancer.

57:20.596 --> 57:22.851
That's what family is, right?

57:22.851 --> 57:24.787
They can't take your pain for you,

57:24.787 --> 57:28.027
but they don't let you give up so easily.

57:29.399 --> 57:31.485
But my dad...

57:31.485 --> 57:33.856
He got distracted by something else, and...

57:34.812 --> 57:38.852
he never really looked at my mom.

57:42.363 --> 57:46.396
Everyone says my mom died of illness,

57:46.396 --> 57:49.009
but to me,

57:50.189 --> 57:53.922
it always felt like she died because of love.

57:56.596 --> 58:00.035
So after that happened,

58:00.035 --> 58:03.176
I left home when I was nineteen.

58:03.176 --> 58:05.993
They said they'd provide room and board,

58:05.993 --> 58:09.206
so I started doing theater.

58:09.206 --> 58:12.026
I see.

58:12.026 --> 58:15.433
I was so angry.

58:16.099 --> 58:19.999
I told myself I'd never fall in love.

58:21.892 --> 58:24.518
Not ever.

58:35.236 --> 58:37.809
Have a seat.

58:44.641 --> 58:47.574
An article's about to come out.

58:47.574 --> 58:49.412
We decided to clear up

58:49.412 --> 58:51.273
the misunderstandings around us ourselves.

58:51.273 --> 58:54.613
She made a big decision.

58:55.744 --> 58:56.845
Misunderstandings?

58:56.845 --> 58:58.572
What exactly are you planning to say?

58:58.572 --> 59:01.161
The truth.

59:04.870 --> 59:05.787
[I never tried to hide it.
I only wanted to protect it]

59:05.787 --> 59:08.911
Ji Hoon and I met as doctor and patient,

59:08.911 --> 59:09.989
but it wasn't an affair.

59:09.989 --> 59:11.624
After your mother passed away,

59:11.624 --> 59:14.252
our relationship became romantic,
and we got married.

59:14.252 --> 59:16.217
And as for you, you weren't being sponsored.

59:16.217 --> 59:20.063
You were simply receiving my one-sided support.

59:21.443 --> 59:24.443
Is that your truth?

59:25.238 --> 59:27.135
Is that your truth too, Dad?

59:27.135 --> 59:28.812
Of course it is...

59:28.812 --> 59:31.345
You really...

59:31.345 --> 59:32.575
still haven't grown up.

59:32.575 --> 59:35.905
You're still hung up on the past,
letting it control you.

59:35.905 --> 59:38.591
Your mom...

59:44.826 --> 59:47.342
Once the article comes out,
people are going to get curious about you.

59:47.342 --> 59:50.566
Reporters will start showing up everywhere.

59:50.566 --> 59:54.513
I'll support you financially,
so go study abroad.

59:58.449 --> 59:59.932
See?

59:59.932 --> 01:00:02.504
This is my truth.

01:00:02.504 --> 01:00:05.292
We're not the kind of family
that keeps each other alive.

01:00:05.292 --> 01:00:07.367
We're the kind that hurts each other
and tears each other down.

01:00:07.367 --> 01:00:09.244
- Shin Ji Su...
- Take my name out of the article.

01:00:09.244 --> 01:00:10.982
Not one line about me.

01:00:10.982 --> 01:00:13.901
I already left that theater company,
and the money you called sponsorship,

01:00:13.901 --> 01:00:17.027
I'll earn it back and pay it all back.

01:00:17.027 --> 01:00:19.058
I'm not part of this family.

01:00:19.058 --> 01:00:21.901
I haven't been for a long time,

01:00:21.901 --> 01:00:24.587
and I never will be again.

01:00:28.044 --> 01:00:31.078
Ji Su.

01:00:31.078 --> 01:00:34.475
I guess that's how you can act
so convincingly without a shred of doubt.

01:00:34.475 --> 01:00:38.193
That kind of love where someone else's pain
doesn't matter in the slightest.

01:00:38.193 --> 01:00:40.999
Doesn't it disgust you?

01:00:40.999 --> 01:00:44.057
People die

01:00:44.057 --> 01:00:47.284
because of that noble love of yours.

01:01:00.739 --> 01:01:02.925
That must have been...

01:01:02.925 --> 01:01:05.945
really hard on you.

01:01:07.469 --> 01:01:10.608
You've been through a lot.

01:01:23.445 --> 01:01:26.455
We managed to save these
out of the wood that got soaked that day.

01:01:26.455 --> 01:01:28.746
But starting tomorrow,
we need to begin cutting,

01:01:28.746 --> 01:01:30.682
so go ahead and place the order for the rest.

01:01:30.682 --> 01:01:32.421
Okay.

01:01:36.739 --> 01:01:39.155
Does my arm smell?

01:01:39.155 --> 01:01:41.637
Yeah, a little.

01:01:41.637 --> 01:01:43.955
Hey, Sua says you need a shower.

01:01:43.955 --> 01:01:45.279
I already showered twice.

01:01:45.279 --> 01:01:47.476
Jin Su, I told you to rest. Why are you here?

01:01:47.476 --> 01:01:50.133
And you guys too, I told you not to stay late.

01:01:50.133 --> 01:01:51.653
Come on.

01:01:51.653 --> 01:01:55.323
You always said woodworkers
shouldn't get shaken so easily.

01:01:55.323 --> 01:01:58.047
So why are you the nervous one?

01:01:58.047 --> 01:01:59.651
I always say this.

01:01:59.651 --> 01:02:02.576
There aren't many clear days
good for woodworking.

01:02:02.576 --> 01:02:05.319
Wood is vulnerable to both water and fire,

01:02:05.319 --> 01:02:07.136
so people have to be the strong ones.

01:02:07.136 --> 01:02:10.337
It's not as easy as it sounds.
That's why I keep saying it like a mantra.

01:02:10.337 --> 01:02:11.140
[Crispy outside, soft inside]

01:02:11.140 --> 01:02:12.410
Oh, right.

01:02:12.410 --> 01:02:14.604
We hired a new person. She'll be starting soon.

01:02:14.604 --> 01:02:16.647
I don't know if it'll lighten
your workload that much,

01:02:16.647 --> 01:02:18.195
but I'm looking forward to it.

01:02:18.195 --> 01:02:19.856
- Be good to her.
- Really?

01:02:19.856 --> 01:02:21.723
I can't wait to see her.

01:02:21.723 --> 01:02:23.102
If you're all done eating...

01:02:23.102 --> 01:02:27.355
Whoever clocks out last
cleans the shop tomorrow!

01:02:30.583 --> 01:02:32.040
Good work today!

01:02:32.040 --> 01:02:34.632
Good night!

01:02:34.632 --> 01:02:37.180
Hey, clean this up before you go!

01:02:37.180 --> 01:02:39.313
Hey!

01:02:43.922 --> 01:02:45.818
Ms. Ui Yeong, are you home?

01:02:45.818 --> 01:02:49.267
Can I come by for a minute?

01:02:53.147 --> 01:02:55.753
First...

01:02:55.753 --> 01:02:58.606
Let's go.

01:03:03.901 --> 01:03:05.525
How was the steak?

01:03:05.525 --> 01:03:08.311
Yeah, it was good.

01:03:15.420 --> 01:03:18.246
I should head in now.

01:03:18.246 --> 01:03:19.933
Get home safe.

01:03:19.933 --> 01:03:22.527
I still have something to say.

01:03:22.527 --> 01:03:23.604
What is it?

01:03:23.604 --> 01:03:27.017
You told me to go after what I love.

01:03:28.004 --> 01:03:30.697
I like you.

01:03:31.941 --> 01:03:32.966
What?

01:03:32.966 --> 01:03:35.598
I know I'm probably not much
of a dating prospect right now.

01:03:35.598 --> 01:03:37.845
But I'm going to really give acting
everything I've got.

01:03:37.845 --> 01:03:39.431
I already have an audition lined up,

01:03:39.431 --> 01:03:42.824
and I'm going to keep going until I make it.

01:03:43.711 --> 01:03:44.981
Hey...

01:03:44.981 --> 01:03:47.193
I'll dress well

01:03:47.193 --> 01:03:49.588
so I won't be embarrassed standing next to you.

01:03:49.588 --> 01:03:51.118
I'll move into

01:03:51.118 --> 01:03:53.705
a decent place so you can come over.

01:03:53.705 --> 01:03:56.096
Places like that restaurant tonight...

01:03:56.096 --> 01:03:59.235
Maybe not all the time, but on special days,

01:03:59.235 --> 01:04:02.228
I'll take you somewhere nice.

01:04:04.919 --> 01:04:07.505
I want to...

01:04:08.685 --> 01:04:11.678
be in love with you.

01:04:15.962 --> 01:04:18.661
Well...

01:04:22.280 --> 01:04:24.813
Mr. Tae Seop?

01:04:52.919 --> 01:04:55.490
[Dating feels different now]

01:04:59.439 --> 01:05:02.656
[2,380 steps out of 8,000]

01:05:06.550 --> 01:05:10.803
[Together, it's romantic]

01:05:15.502 --> 01:05:18.674
[I hope you protect what you love]

01:05:18.674 --> 01:05:21.748
[You've been through a lot]

01:05:23.135 --> 01:05:27.098
Who could've seen this coming
from a blind date?

01:05:27.098 --> 01:05:28.575
- Ms. Ui Yeong!
- Lee Ui Yeong!

01:05:28.575 --> 01:05:30.839
You've got two guys on the hook.

01:05:30.839 --> 01:05:33.007
Why are you the one suffering?

01:05:33.007 --> 01:05:36.801
It's not even like
my heart's leaning either way...

01:05:36.801 --> 01:05:38.198
Your button's undone.

01:05:38.198 --> 01:05:40.174
It's because of you.

01:05:40.174 --> 01:05:42.045
I couldn't stand not seeing you.

01:05:42.045 --> 01:05:43.796
Instead of trying to sort it out on your own...

01:05:43.796 --> 01:05:45.896
There will come a moment

01:05:45.896 --> 01:05:48.079
when things get clearer
once you face them directly.

01:05:48.079 --> 01:05:50.568
You just need more certainty. Right?

01:05:50.568 --> 01:05:53.794
I'll wait for you.
